{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 584.0, 797.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [63.72272143774069, 63.730009407337725, 266.88575096277276, 109.4656632173095], "text": "Other printing shops on campus are located at the shopping area to the east of Guanchou Yuan canteen, C Building, south section of Building 7, south section of Building 25 and Zijing Buildings 1, 4, 6, 8, 10 and 12.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [63.72272143774069, 120.71213546566322, 256.390243902439, 130.7578125], "text": "Nearby campus there are three large supermarkets:", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [62.021484375, 134.719462890625, 280.166015625, 246.657490234375], "text": "Supermarket Name Opening Hours Lotus Supermarket ( \u6613\u521d\u83b2\u82b1 ) Monday to Sunday: Located in the Wudaokou area 9:00am \u2013 9:00pm BHG Supermarket ( \u534e\u8054 ) Monday to Sunday: Located in the Wudaokou area 9:00am \u2013 9:00pm Carrefour (\u5bb6\u4e50\u798f) Monday to Sunday: Located in the Zhongguancun area 8:30am \u2013 10:00pm", "type": "Table"}, {"bbox": [62.396323912869065, 136.21969818474267, 198.83791569720796, 156.09781583180148], "text": "Supermarket Name", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [199.21275523507703, 136.21969818474267, 278.67873726331834, 156.09781583180148], "text": "Opening Hours", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [62.396323912869065, 156.09781583180148, 198.83791569720796, 186.85263936121325], "text": "Lotus Supermarket ( \u6613\u521d\u83b2\u82b1 )", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [199.21275523507703, 156.09781583180148, 278.67873726331834, 186.85263936121325], "text": "Monday to Sunday:", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [62.396323912869065, 186.85263936121325, 198.83791569720796, 217.60746289062502], "text": "Located in the Wudaokou area", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [199.21275523507703, 186.85263936121325, 278.67873726331834, 217.60746289062502], "text": "9:00am \u2013 9:00pm", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [62.396323912869065, 186.85263936121325, 198.83791569720796, 217.60746289062502], "text": "BHG Supermarket ( \u534e\u8054 )", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [199.21275523507703, 186.85263936121325, 278.67873726331834, 217.60746289062502], "text": "Monday to Sunday:", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [62.396323912869065, 217.60746289062502, 198.83791569720796, 248.36228642003678], "text": "Located in the Wudaokou area", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [199.21275523507703, 217.60746289062502, 278.67873726331834, 248.36228642003678], "text": "9:00am \u2013 9:00pm", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [62.77116345073813, 217.23240406709562, 198.83791569720796, 246.1119334788603], "text": "Carrefour (\u5bb6\u4e50\u798f)", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [199.21275523507703, 217.23240406709562, 278.67873726331834, 246.1119334788603], "text": "Monday to Sunday:", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [62.77116345073813, 246.1119334788603, 198.83791569720796, 274.99146289062503], "text": "Located in the Zhongguancun area", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [199.21275523507703, 246.1119334788603, 278.67873726331834, 274.99146289062503], "text": "8:30am \u2013 10:00pm", "type": "TableCell"}, {"bbox": [63.72272143774069, 274.7470703125, 248.14377406931962, 304.40451552210726], "text": "Off-Campus Supermarkets Online Shopping", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [63.72272143774069, 310.5498046875, 281.8793324775353, 392.1269990592662], "text": "Online shopping is very convenient and efficient in China. Payment can be made using Alipay or a Chinese bank card (when applying for a bank card, ask for the option of online purchases to be allowed). Some businesses will also accept payment upon delivery. When making purchases online by using Alipay or a bank card, be very mindful of one's personal information and privacy.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [302.12066752246466, 63.730009407337725, 424.3183568677792, 72.77294921875], "text": "\u2022 C Building China Post branch", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [302.12066752246466, 75.72624647224835, 504.53401797175866, 85.615234375], "text": "Operating hours: Monday to Sunday, 9:00am - 4:30pm", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [302.12066752246466, 87.72248353715898, 490.29011553273426, 96.90087890625], "text": "* Note that this branch cannot send overseas parcels.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [301.6953125, 106.24072265625, 394.33119383825414, 114.80224609375], "text": "DHL Express delivery", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [301.6953125, 116.96331138287864, 500.785622593068, 138.70649106302918], "text": "DHL Express delivery point: 1st Floor, Zijing Apartment Building 9", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [302.12066752246466, 146.9539040451552, 443.81001283697043, 155.20131702728128], "text": "General Deliveries Service Station", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [300.5546875, 159.5556640625, 516.5288831835686, 227.17873941674506], "text": "There is a general delivery service point located in the northern part of the campus behind Zijing Apartment Building 14. For students, all deliveries made to an oncampus dormitory address will be sent to this site, where parcels and packages can be collected. Parcels can also be sent from the service station.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [294.482421875, 226.4912109375, 529.048828125, 397.7216796875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [65.5859375, 484.50439453125, 299.8716302952503, 524.19873046875], "text": "Postal and Delivery Services", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [63.72272143774069, 542.0799623706491, 276.6315789473684, 563.8231420507997], "text": "Letters sent to on-campus addresses should be written in the following format:", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [84.71373555840822, 595.3132643461901, 179.92297817715018, 604.36572265625], "text": "To: XXX (Recipient's name)", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [96.66796875, 610.3085606773283, 256.390243902439, 643.2982126058325], "text": "Room xx, Zi Jing Building ## Tsinghua University, Haidian District, Beijing P.R. China 100084", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [63.72272143774069, 669.5399811853246, 163.4300385109114, 678.5371589840075], "text": "\u2022 Post office (China Post)", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [63.72272143774069, 681.5362182502352, 260.13863928112966, 703.2793979303857], "text": "Zhaolanyuan area (south of the old university gate) Opening hours: Monday to Sunday, 8:30am - 5:30pm", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [63.72272143774069, 711.384765625, 257.88960205391527, 731.7704609595485], "text": "* For sending parcels overseas, a passport must first be shown at the service counter.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [299.157421875, 485.088134765625, 323.623828125, 506.491943359375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [299.8716302952503, 487.3471307619944, 479.0449293966624, 506.09125117591725], "text": "4 Transportation", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [302.12066752246466, 535.87353515625, 441.56097560975604, 550.66162109375], "text": "Campus Shuttle Bus", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [301.6953125, 557.0752587017874, 510.53145057766363, 603.58740234375], "text": "The campus has an electric powered shuttle bus service. The shuttle buses are all purple in color and stop along the road when hailed. The buses operate along different routes, including the following:", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [302.12066752246466, 616.3066792097836, 422.81899871630293, 626.5478515625], "text": "\u2022 Outer route operating times:", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [302.12066752246466, 627.71533203125, 500.0359435173299, 673.63623046875], "text": "Monday to Friday, 7:20am - 6:00pm Weekends and holidays, 8:30am - 5:30pm Notices will inform of the specific summer and winter vacation operating times.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [302.12066752246466, 682.5869140625, 509.7817715019255, 727.7294921875], "text": "Method of operation: Leaves from the West gate. Runs both clockwise and anticlockwise along the route. Buses depart approximately every 20 minutes in the same direction (every 10 minutes in alternating directions). On", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [534.953125, 745.630859375, 547.2657252888318, 755.7629350893698], "text": "", "type": "PageFooter"}], "doc_id": "guojixueshengshenghuozhinanyingwen9.1.pdf", "page_index": 17, "pdf_path": "/mmfs1/data/group/ems036/lxu/mpvrdu/.data/mmlongbench/documents/guojixueshengshenghuozhinanyingwen9.1.pdf", "source": "marker"}